<title>USA: Allied Holdings Q1 net profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Allied Holdings Q1 net profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>DECATUR, Ga. 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In Thousands, Except Per Share Data)</p>
<p>					     For the Three Months Ended</p>
<p>								March 31</p>
<p>							  1997	   1996</p>
<p> Revenues					   $96,393     $93,396</p>
<p> Income before extraordinary item		 198	   360</p>
<p> Net income (loss)				    198	( 575)</p>
<p>Earnings per share:</p>
<p> Income before extraordinary item		0.03	  0.05</p>
<p> Net income (loss)				   0.03	( 0.07)</p>
<p>Weighted average common shares outstanding</p>
<p>							  7,725	 7,725</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said increased revenues in the current quarter were offset by rising fuel expenses.</p>
<p>Allied also incurred a $0.09 charge for start-ups costs related to its Axis Group in the 1997 quarter.</p>
<p>The company also said previous quarter's net income includes an extradordinary loss of $935,000 for the early extinguishment of debt.</p>
<p>The full company name is Allied Holdings Inc.</p>
</text>
